      "description": "We’re on a mission to make laundry less of a chore. So with our free Circuit Go app, you can quickly check availability, book a machine and start washing.\n\n \n\nInstant, reliable payments, straight through the app\nSimple to book – schedule your laundry in advance\nSkip the queues – check machine availability in your laundry\nSave some cash – in-app coupons add up to great savings\nAll on your phone – get notified when your cycle’s complete\n \n\nReady to wash? Visit nearest Circuit launderette, load your laundry, choose your machine and programme, and GO.\n\n \n\nPlease note: Circuit Go relies on your phone having an internet connection. As long as you're online in the laundry room, you can activate our machines and see how long’s left on your cycle.\n\n \n\nYour Circuit Go app account works separately to the terminal you might see on the wall in your launderette. Rather just tap and go? Pay contactlessly through the terminal.\n\n \n\nBy downloading the Circuit Go app, you agree to the following terms:\n\nYou accept that you have a non-exclusive licence to use the app. You agree not to copy the app or infringe our intellectual property rights in the app.\n\n \n\nThere’s no minimum amount of top-up credit. Payments are processed through a third-party payment provider. Circuit won’t store your card details.\n\n \n\nYou can refund any part-used top-up credit yourself – use Withdrawing Balance in the Balance area in the app. Refunds incur an administration charge of £2.00. Your part-used credit will need to cover the £2.00 admin charged to be able to process the refund.\n\n \n\nNo refund will be processed for any free credit or coupons. Balance transfer coupons will expire 12 months after the date of purchase. Visit circuit.co.uk for more information.",
